«Celaena Sardothien is the king's Champion--yet she is far from loyal to the crown, for the man she serves is bent on evil. But working against her master in secret is no easy task. As Celaena tries to untangle the mysteries buried within the glass castle, she can trust no one, not even her supposed allies Crown Prince Dorian, Captain of the Guard Chaol, and foreign princess Nehemia.Then, an unspeakable tragedy shatters Celaena's world. She must decide once and for all where her loyalties lie ... and whom she will fight for.An action-packed and romantic adventure that readers will never want to leave (Kirkus Reviews), the next chapter in this smash hit New York Times best-selling series is sure to please Sarah Maas's enormous and ever-growing fan-base--and to set the stage for an explosive third book."¼
¹O Tsarls Manx ekhei mia palia Rols-Rois, me mia paraxene pinakida pou graphei NOS4A2. M auten pegainei bolta ta paidakia s ena paramuthenio meros, ton Khristougennotopo. Ki ekei, ste khora tes diestrammenes phantasias tou, oi athooi episkeptes tou metallassontai se plasmata tromaktika san ton idio...
E Biktoria Makouin ekhei to kharisma na briskei pragmata: Ena khameno mprasele, mia photographia... Sumbainei opote pernaei me to podelato tes ten palia gephura sto dasos. Den to khei pei se kanenan -kala kala den xerei oute ki ekeine pos ginetai.
Ki erkhetai e mera pou e Bik briskei sto dromo tes ton Tsarli...
Ekhoun perasei khronia apo tote. To monadiko paidi pou glitose pote apo ton Tsarli einai tora mia nea gunaika pou de thelei na thumatai ten peripeteia tes. Alla o Tsarli den ekhei xekhasei. Kai gia na ekdikethei, th arpaxei apo te Bik auto pou metra perissotero ste zoe tes. Kati pou den mporei na antikatastesei me tipota.
E makhe arkhizei. Kai e Bik xerei pos den ekhei epiloge: e tha aphanisei ton Tsarli e tha khathei e idia prospathontas na sosei o,ti agapa...."Ô

Ñ
Einai kalokairi tou 1978, otan o Arni, enas adexios kai monakhikos ephebos, eroteuetai me ten prote matia mia sarabaliasmene Plimouth tou '58. O Ntenis, o eroas tou skholeiou, philos tou Arni kai sukhna prostates tou, kanei o,ti mporei gia na tou bgalei apo to mualo ten idea. Alla ekeinos to 'khei apophasisei: Tha kanei dike tou ten Kristin, me opoiodepote kostos...
E Kristin den einai ena tukhaio autokineto. Mporei na moiazei me apolithoma mias alles epokhes, alla ekhei mesa tes psukhe. Etsi pisteuei o Arni. Kai den xerei akome poso dikio ekhei...
Oso o Arni paskhizei na ten episkeuasei, toso pathiazetai mazi tes. Kai toso perissotero e Kristin moiazei n' apokta siga siga dike tes zoe -e mepos einai mono e phantasia tous; Auto elpizei o Ntenis... os te stigme pou stous skoteinous dromous tou esukhou proastiou tous arkhizoun na skotonontai anthropoi... ki o Ntenis den mporei pia na arnethei ten tromaktike aletheia: e Kristin einai zontane...
E "Kristin" einai ena muthistorema pou trekhei me diakosia, murizei akaute benzine kai einai plemmurismeno stous ekhous tou rok ent rol. Ena dunato kokteil uperphusikou tromou, kakias kai orges... Mia istoria gia ton tropo pou mas stoikheionei to misos -alla kamia phora kai e agape. Kai gia ton tropo pou ta pragmata kleboun ena kommati apo ton eauto mas ki ustera peismonoun ki arnountai na pethanoun..."Ü
Ù"Mia pragmatika kale istoria tromou tha brei khoreuontas to dromo tes pros to kentro tes zoes sou, anagnoste, kai th' anakalupsei ten kruphe portoula tou domatiou pou nomizes pos kaneis allos den exere oti uperkhe...""â
ßO Stephen King epistrephei me mia nea sulloge diegematon!
Eikosi apokosmes istories, kathe mia me enan xekhoristo prologo apo ton idio ton suggraphea, opou apokaluptei to pos ten egrapse kai giati.
Enas nekros pou xanazei sunekhos te zoe tou, epanalambanontas ta idia lathe... Enas arthrographos pou anakaluptei oti mporei na skotonei anthropous graphontas tis nekrologies tous... Ena zeugari pou kanei mia sumphonia me ton Diabolo nomizontas pos mporei na kerdisei...
Trianta pente khronia meta te "Nukhterine bardia", ten prote tou sulloge diegematon, o King apodeiknuei oti katekhei akome ten idia -an okhi megalutere- ikanoteta na se kanei na tromaxeis kai tautokhrona na skephteis mesa se liges molis selides.
"To Pazari ton kakon oneiron" einai enas thesauros, kai oi istories tou apo ta kalutera dora tou King ston Pisto Anagnoste tou.
<>, leei o idios. <>"ç
ä
O Ritsarnt Nebil einai o teleutaios zontanos anthropos ste Ge.. alla den einai monos. Oloi oi upoloipoi anthropoi, antres, gunaikes kai paidia, ekhoun ginei brikolakes - kai oloi tous dipsoun gia to aima tou. Te mera, o Nebil ginetai kunegos - anazeta tis krupsones tous mesa sta ereipia tou politismou kai tous exolothreuei. Te nukhta tampouronetai sto spiti tou kai proseukhetai na erthei e auge. Omos, poso kairo mporei na epizesei enas anthropos se enan kosmo gemato brikolakes;"ë
èOla ta kala pragmata teleionoun kapote, Piste Anagnoste. Akoma ki o Stephen King den mporei na plasei mia istoria pou na diarkesei gia panta.
E anazetese, e dike sou kai tou Rolant, plesiazei sten oloklerose tes. O Rolant phtanei ston Purgo. Kai suneidetopoiei oti tha prepei na kanei monos, khoris tous suntrophous tou, auto to teleutaio, zophero kommati tou taxidiou tou.
To biblio arkhizei, mia porta anoigei pros tis eskhaties tes phantasias tou King. Ephtases os edo. Prokhora ligo akome.
Prokhora os to telos. O ekhos pou akous isos einai e porta pou kleinei me patago piso sou. Kalos erthes sto Mauro Purgo..."ñ
îE Mponi Gouinter einai mia ergazomene suzugos kai metera. E douleia tes thelei gero stomakhi: e Mponi katharizei kai apolumainei spitia opou diaprakhthekan egklemata, xeplenei to aima ton athoon kai tis amarties ton enokhon. Duskola te phantazetai kaneis na tromazei, an skephtei ti blepei kathe mera, kai poso kala gnorizei poso skoteine mporei na einai e psukhe ton anthropon.
Ti einai, loipon, auto pou ten kanei na xestomisei tetoia logia;
Giati ginontai tosoi polloi phonoi sten periokhe opou douleuei;
Kai poia skhese ekhoun me te spania petalouda pou emphanizetai sta spitia ton thumaton;
O Graham Masterton epistrephei me to pio orimo muthistorema tes karieras tou, ena aristotekhnika grammeno thriler musteriou, opou ta oria metaxu uperphusikou kai pragmatikou einai exokhos dusdiakrita kai o anagnostes prospathei mekhri ten teleutaia selida na mantepsei ten katalexe."ô
ñFirst came the man: a young wanderer in a fatigue coat and long hair. Then came the legend, as John Rambo sprang from the pages of First Bloodto take his place in the American cultural landscape. This remarkable novel pits a young Vietnam veteran against a small-town cop who doesn't know whom he's dealing with--or how far Rambo will take him into a life-and-death struggle through the woods, hills, and caves of rural Kentucky.This time when Johnny comes marching home be afraid. Be very afraid."ô	
ñ	Enas mesaionikos thrulos gia mia stratia phantasmaton pou diatrekhei te Boreia Europe aiones tora, ena normandiko khorio pou krubei kala ta mustika tou, merika kommatia zakhares, enas nearos apo ta upobathmismena proastia tou Parisiou pou purpolei autokineta kai kategoreitai gia ten apanthrakose enos megistana, mia geraia kuria pou kapnizei poura kai xerei ta panta, mazi me ton idiorruthmo epitheorete Antamsmper kai tous exisou paraxenous sunergates tou apo to Tmema Anthropoktonion uphainoun ton isto autou tou sunarpastikou astunomikou muthistorematos tes Gallidas suggrapheos, pou ekhei demiourgesei skhole sto eidos.
Isorropontas ste lepte gramme metaxu phantasias kai pragmatikotetas, o aitherobamon eroas tes Phrent Bargkas prospathei na lusei to musterio ton phonon tessaron antron sto Orntempek tes Normandias, sto opoio kataphthanei gia na boethesei mia allokote oikogeneia pou ekhei prokalesei ten orge ton khorikon. Prokhorontas, omos, olo kai pio bathia tis ereunes, me te sundrome tou topikou enomotarkhe ki enos kome me upseles diasundeseis, to skotadi guro tou puknonei, anti na dialuetai, kai o epitheoretes Antamsmper buthizetai stis autapates, kathos upoptoi apodeiknuontai athooi kai anthropoi uperano pases upopsias ekhoun na krupsoun polla."õ
òWINNER: Independent Book Award/Fantasy: "A powerfully written story mixing old magic and Native American lore, Sister Raven kept our genre enthusiast judges captivated page after page."
Bound by magic to Old Mother, Beetle Girl lives a lonely life on the fringes of her Native American society. When forced into the role of Keeper of the Ravens, she must break the bonds of her cruel mother, confront a powerful shape-shifter who threatens to destroy the village, and solve the mystery of her past."	®Gáz@"	®Gáz@"	…ëQ¸@"	…ëQ¸@"	=
